B.VS=new A.eb(u.Y,u.X,"Qur\u2019an 39:62 (Saheeh International): \u201cAllah is the Creator of all things, and He is, over all things, Disposer of affairs.\u201d")
B.VH=new A.eb("Allah alone deserves worship",u.C,"Qur\u2019an 4:36 (Saheeh International): \u201cWorship Allah and associate nothing with Him.\u201d")
B.VN=new A.eb("Shirk is the greatest sin",u.cg,"Qur\u2019an 4:48 (Saheeh International): \u201cIndeed, Allah does not forgive association with Him, but He forgives what is less than that for whom He wills.\u201d")
B.VM=new A.eb("Allah\u2019s Names and Attributes are perfect",u.eh,"Qur\u2019an 42:11 (The Clear Quran): \u201cThere is nothing like Him, for He \u02f9alone\u02fa is the All-Hearing, All-Seeing.\u201d")
B.VG=new A.eb("Allah is above His creation",u.f,"Qur\u2019an 20:5 (Hilali and Khan): \u201cThe Most Gracious (All\xe2h) rose over (Istaw\xe2) the (Mighty) Throne (in a manner that suits His Majesty).\u201d")
B.VL=new A.eb("The Qur\u2019an is Allah\u2019s Speech",u.gJ,"Qur\u2019an 9:6 (Saheeh International): \u201cuntil he hears the words of Allah.\u201d")
B.VO=new A.eb("Follow the Prophet \ufdfa and the Salaf",u.da,"Hadith source: Sahih al-Bukhari 3651 \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Bukhari 3651\nNarrator/topic: Virtue of the earliest generations.\nQuoted translation: \u201cThe best of my followers are those living in my generation and then those who will follow the latter.\u201d\nHadith source: Sahih Muslim 2533 \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Muslim 2533\nNarrator/topic: Virtue of the earliest generations.\nQuoted translation: \u201cThe best of my Umma would be those of the generation nearest to mine. Then those nearest to them, then those nearest to them.\u201d")
B.VQ=new A.eb("Iman includes belief, speech, and action",u.gL,"Qur\u2019an 8:2 (Saheeh International): \u201cand when His verses are recited to them, it increases them in faith.\u201d")
B.VR=new A.eb("Believe in the six pillars of iman",u.L,"Hadith source: Sahih Muslim 8a \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Muslim 8a\nNarrator/topic: Hadith of Jibril about iman.\nQuoted translation: \u201cIt is that you believe in Allah and His angels and His Books and His Messengers and in the Last Day and in qadar (fate), both in its good and in its evil aspects.\u201d")
B.VJ=new A.eb("The Hereafter is real",u.fP,"Qur\u2019an 75:22-23 (Saheeh International): \u201c[Some] faces, that Day, will be radiant, Looking at their Lord.\u201d\nHadith source: Sahih al-Bukhari 7434 \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Bukhari 7434\nNarrator/topic: Believers seeing Allah on the Day of Resurrection.\nQuoted translation: \u201cYou will see your Lord as you see this moon, and you will have no trouble in seeing Him.\u201d")
B.VF=new A.eb("Love and honor the Companions",u.q,u.bk)
B.VI=new A.eb("Avoid bid\u2018ah in religion",u.cZ,"Qur\u2019an 5:3 (Saheeh International): \u201cThis day I have perfected for you your religion and completed My favor upon you and have approved for you Islam as religion.\u201d\nHadith source: Sahih Muslim 867 \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Muslim 867\nNarrator/topic: The Prophet\u2019s guidance is the best guidance.\nQuoted translation: \u201cThe best guidance is the guidance given by Muhammad.\u201d\nHadith source: Sahih Muslim 1718 \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Muslim 1718\nNarrator/topic: Rejection of invented religious actions.\nQuoted translation: \u201cHe who did any act for which there is no sanction from our behalf, that is to be rejected.\u201d")
B.VP=new A.eb("Avoid reckless takfir",u.an,"Qur\u2019an 4:48 (Saheeh International): \u201cIndeed, Allah does not forgive association with Him, but He forgives what is less than that for whom He wills.\u201d\nQur\u2019an 49:10 (Saheeh International): \u201cThe believers are but brothers.\u201d")
B.VK=new A.eb("Obey Muslim rulers in what is lawful",u.k,"Qur\u2019an 4:59 (Saheeh International): \u201cO you who have believed, obey Allah and obey the Messenger and those in authority among you.\u201d\nHadith source: Sahih al-Bukhari 7056 \u2014 Sunnah.com lookup: Bukhari 7056\nNarrator/topic: Obedience to rulers and the condition of clear disbelief.\nQuoted translation: \u201cunless you see clear disbelief, for which you have proof from Allah.\u201d")
